bb-plugin-ponytail
==================

The skills in skills/ are adapted from ponytail by Dietrich Gebert
(https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail), version 5.3.3, MIT licensed —
see LICENSE in this directory, which is the upstream licence verbatim.

Adaptations made for BB (all recorded in the skills themselves):

- Slash-command invocations (`/ponytail lite`, `/ponytail-audit`, …) became
  ordinary phrases ("ponytail lite", "ponytail review"), because BB exposes
  skills by name rather than as slash commands.
- Claude Code's prompt band, `PONYTAIL_DEFAULT_MODE` and
  `~/.config/ponytail/config.json` are removed: BB has no status line and the
  plugin persists nothing between threads.
- Upstream's `/plugin` install and auto-update instructions are replaced with
  a pointer to this port's version.

Not ported: upstream's harness hooks (mode tracker, band import, session
accounting, subagent). They attach to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Qoder and
OpenCode plugin APIs, none of which BB reproduces.

Original work: server.ts, package.json, README.md, test/ — MIT, prismatic7.
